@startuml detection
title US-03: Detection - Signal Loss Identified

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

participant "Alert\nEvaluator\n(leader)" as Evaluator
database "Redis\nentity:live:{id}" as Redis
database "TimescaleDB\nposition_history" as TSDB
queue "Kafka\nalerts" as Kafka

note over Evaluator
  Only the elected leader instance
  runs evaluation. Followers are
  on standby. (ADR-005)
end note

loop every evaluation cycle
  Evaluator -> Redis : HGETALL entity:live:*
  Redis --> Evaluator : { entity_id, timestamp_ms } for all live entities

  alt entity key missing (TTL expired)
    note over Redis
      TTL = SIGNAL_LOSS_THRESHOLD_MS
      Expired key means no ping received
      within the threshold window.
    end note

    Evaluator -> TSDB : SELECT last known position\nWHERE entity_id = ? ORDER BY timestamp_ms DESC LIMIT 1
    TSDB --> Evaluator : { lat, lon, timestamp_ms }

    Evaluator -> Kafka : publish to alerts\n{ type: SIGNAL_LOSS, entity_id,\n  last_known_position, duration_ms }

  else entity seen within threshold
    Evaluator -> Evaluator : no action
  end
end

@enduml
